//
// Like gen_compress_golden.cpp, this links the actual game sources
// (Core/Libraries/Source/Compression/EAC/refdecode.cpp and refencode.cpp
// at the baseline commit) rather than a transcription, so the §6 budget
// comparison for rzh-compress is against the real C code, compiled the way
// the game builds it. The corpora (zeros / text / random, 64 KiB each) are
// generated by the driver with the same LCG and the same text template the
